                <flipboard active-id='1' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                  <story-points>
                    <story-point caption='This analysis explores cellphone pricing patterns across brands, operating systems,&#10;and hardware features to understand market segmentation and pricing behavior.&#10;' captured-sheet='' id='1' />
                    <story-point caption='This view provides an overview of cellphone price distribution&#10;and explains how key features such as RAM, camera quality,&#10;and battery capacity influence pricing.&#10;' captured-sheet='Market Overview &amp; Price Drivers' id='5' />
                    <story-point caption='This view highlights market concentration, brand dominance,&#10;high-end phone contribution, and operating system distribution&#10;across the cellphone market.&#10;' captured-sheet='Market Structure &amp; Strategic Insights' id='6' />
                    <story-point caption='Overall, the cellphone market is highly segmented, where pricing&#10;is driven by brand positioning and performance features, with a&#10;small number of brands dominating premium segments.&#10;' captured-sheet='' id='7' />
                  </story-points>
                </flipboard>
              </zone>
